Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:08:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 07/16] rnsd: Reticulum daemon service, shipped config and
 python-rns package

python-rns installs rns as a PEP 517 wheel so pip can upgrade it in place
(portal Update button). PYTHON_RNS_VERSION uses ?= so build.sh can pin the
LATEST PyPI release at build time (it also rewrites the .hash digest and
pre-seeds the dl/ cache with the verified sdist); 1.5.2 is the offline
fallback. S82rnsd + /etc/reticulum/config ported verbatim (transport node,
TCPServerInterface 0.0.0.0:4242, AutoInterface on the gadget LAN, two
RNS-testnet uplinks).
